#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD1073 expect=violation domain=AE
#note "FRESH: the OTHER TWO prohibited qualifiers, AESTAT and AEREASND, and deliberately NO AEOCCUR. Predicted VIOLATION with count EXACTLY 1, not 2: the whole three-way or-tree is one dataset-level constant, so two matching disjuncts still yield a single finding. Pins disjuncts 2 and 3, which the twin leaves untested, and pins the count semantics at the same time. Count-only pin, matching the twin."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
#expectViolationCount 1
dataset AE label="Adverse Events"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col AESEQ    type=Num
col AETERM   type=Char
col AESTAT   type=Char
col AEREASND type=Char
---
S1 | AE | 001 | 1 | HEADACHE | NOT DONE | Subject refused
